	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Hodie expectamus legatos nostros missos ad <persName ref="p8112">regem <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Gallię</persName>; scripserunt autem in hęc verba:</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="de">Nachdem als sy verhört sindt <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>von k[öniglicher] m[ajestat], ist ein antwort gefallen: 1. So das regiment zuͦ <placeName>Ensesheim</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>alle gefangenen ußlast one alle entgeltnuß, ouch, so eim etwas were genomen, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>das im restituieren on allen synen kosten, 2° Das sy niemants furterhin <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>verhinderen wellen, die zuͦr kron von <placeName ref="l832">Franckreich</placeName> welle ziehen, ein freye <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>baß geben für und für, 3° Das sy wellent annemen, das uff dem <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nehsten reichstag werde gehandlet, 4° Das sy willig wellen syn, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>so er ein schatzung wurde uff sy legen, ouch im probant zuͦ schicken <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nach syner notturfft: <foreign xml:lang="la">si hos articulos iuraverint se servaturos, regem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ab omni persecutione et incursione velle hanc regionem servare.</foreign></s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>hoc est?</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Rex <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName> id non faciet, aut si promiserit nunc temporis, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>non servaturus est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Vestri legati apud nos sunt, expectant nostros, qui hodie venient <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>a rege splendide excepti et honorifice dimissi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Scripsit <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>etiam d. <persName ref="p2916">Schertlinus</persName> (cui hodie misi libellum tuum per certum nuncium <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>in castra) non omnibus esse credendum, qui varia spargant de isto bello <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ac de <persName ref="p18250">Mauricio</persName> duce.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Salvas esse res bellicas.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>se non dedit, misit tertiam legationem ad regem, et scribit <persName ref="p8374">Hedio</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>legatos istos, qui 7. maii missi sunt ad regem, aut pacem aut <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>bellum allaturos.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Comitia habentur <placeName ref="l569">Wormatiae</placeName> ab episcopis, <placeName ref="l1028">Trevirensi</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName ref="l267">Coloniensi</placeName>, <placeName ref="l307">Moguntino</placeName>, <placeName ref="l569">Wormaciensi</placeName> et <placeName ref="l471">Spirensi</placeName>; etiam <persName>Palatinus</persName> cum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>baronibus et nobilibus praesentes sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quidnam <persName>Gallo</persName> respondendum sit, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>consultabunt.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Varii praeterea rumores sparguntur, de quibus scripsi <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>per <persName ref="p5189">Heldium</persName>, <placeName ref="l18">Augustanum</placeName> concionatorem.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Nos nihil omnino de <lb xml:id="p1z26"/><persName>Mauriciano</persName> exercitu audimus.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Nobilitas tota territa est tam in <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l2836">Sungavia</placeName> quam in <placeName ref="l2774">Brisagoia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Miles sine duce haeret nescio in <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quo loco; ad nos confluxerunt ingens nobilium multitudo cum uxoribus <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>et liberis.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 10. maii 1552.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/><placeName ref="l1122">Parma</placeName> liberata est ab obsidione.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quid si <persName ref="p18538">Cęsar</persName> hunc exercitum s<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ibi adiungeret?</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Brevi ad vos veniet filius <persName ref="p4744">Pauli Fagii</persName> demortui, a quo quę in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> agantur<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>, fuse audietis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dominis piissimis et <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>doctissimis <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bibliandro</persName> et m. <persName ref="p495">Henrycho <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>suis in domino obser<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>vandissimis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
